{"id":"632748","name":"烤葱油饼","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/632748/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"一小把"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"少许"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"少许(40以下)"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"少许"},{"name":"蜂蜜水","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"择好的葱，洗净，切碎，备用。","img":"images/632748/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"面粉中放入少许酵母和温水,搅拌成稍软的面团，醒发两倍大，揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/632748/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"擀成方形，放上油、五香粉和葱花。","img":"images/632748/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"叠成三层。","img":"images/632748/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"已叠好，如图所示。","img":"images/632748/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切成长方块。","img":"images/632748/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"表面刷蜂蜜水，粘白芝麻，放入烤盘中。","img":"images/632748/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"上下火180度，烤15分钟。","img":"images/632748/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"已烤好，如图所示。","img":"images/632748/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取出放凉。","img":"images/632748/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/632748/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/632748/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"葱香浓郁，酥脆可口。","img":"images/632748/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}